  "question": {
    "text": "A committee of 4 persons is to be formed from 2 ladies, 2 old men and 4 young men such that it includes at least 1 lady, at least 1 old man and at most 2 young men. Then the total number of ways in which this committee can be formed is :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "\n40\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n41\n",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "\n16\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n32",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0182_7278c7e1f417.png\"><br>\nRequired number of ways\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& ={ }^2 \\mathrm{C}_1 \\times{ }^2 \\mathrm{C}_1 \\times{ }^2 \\mathrm{C}_2+{ }^2 \\mathrm{C}_1 \\times{ }^2 \\mathrm{C}_2 \\times{ }^4 \\mathrm{C}_1+{ }^2 \\mathrm{C}_2 \\times \\\\\n& { }^2 \\mathrm{C}_1 \\times{ }^4 \\mathrm{C}_1+{ }^2 \\mathrm{C}_2 \\times{ }^2 \\mathrm{C}_2 \\times{ }^4 \\mathrm{C}_0 \\\\\n& =2 \\times 2 \\times \\frac{4 \\times 3}{2} \\\\\n& \\quad \\quad \\quad 2 \\times 1 \\times 4+1 \\times 2 \\times 4+1 \\times 1 \\times 1\n\\end{aligned}\n$$"
  }
